   "text": "University of Massachusetts Amherst - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Massachusetts Amherst\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUniversity of Massachusetts is a top 30 public school located in Amherst, Massachusetts, a dynamic college town under two hours from Boston. We are the flagship university of the University of Massachusetts system. Our revolutionary spirit drives students to explore career-making opportunities during their studies so they can make a difference in the real world. We offer meaningful research collaborations with faculty, multi-industry companies and tech hubs.Amherst CampusLocated in the picturesque Pioneer Valley, Amherst Campus is less than two hours from Boston, Massachusetts and has a traditional American university setting. Amherst offers the freedom to express your creativity, kilometers of hiking and biking trails and opportunities to attend cultural events throughout the entire historic valley.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:08\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:08\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$58,000.00\nMin: US$24,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n9%\n2,880 of 32,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n1931\nCampus(es)\nAmherst\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nThere is currently no on-campus graduate housing. Off campus housing information can be found online.\nhttps://offcampushousing.umass.edu/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZdH92R0VUes\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
